    "body": "The login page does not let move past after I enter the earlier working account details (email and password) and click on sign-in.\r\n**Note**: I'm using the **local tag for the akto images** based on the default docker-compose.yml. I also see a recent commit made in `apps/dashboard/web/polaris_web/web/src/apps/main/App.js` to import TokenValidator - not sure if it has anything to do with this login issue based on latest release.\r\n\r\nUpdate: **I clicked on sign-up link (instead of sign in link)** and it has started with onboarding process. I'm uploading my postman collection and will run the tests and let you know if generating the vulnerability reports post the test works\r\n\r\n",
